 resort,brundhavan garden nature stay,brundhavan garden hill resort,brundhavan garden official website,brundhavan garden resort bookingb:{"metadata":[["$","title","0",{"children":"Wooden Room | Brundhavan Garden Resort"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"Stay in our Wooden Room at Brundhavan Garden Resort. <p>Featuring rustic wooden décor, the 160 sq. feet wooden room offers a unique aesthetic and includes a king-size bed, TV, and an attached bathroom. This room combines natural charm with modern conveniences and room service for a truly relaxing stay, priced at ₹2000 per night&nbsp;</p>"}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"author","content":"Brundhavan Garden"}],["$","meta","3",{"name":"keywords","content":"$14"}],["$","meta","4",{"name":"creator","content":"Brundhavan Garden"}],["$","meta","5",{"name":"publisher","content":"Brundhavan Garden"}],["$","meta","6",{"name":"robots","content":"index, follow"}],["$","meta","7",{"name":"googlebot","content":"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"}],["$","meta","8",{"name":"format-detection","content":"telephone=no, address=no, email=no"}],["$","meta","9",{"property":"og:title","content":"Wooden Room | Brundhavan Garden Resort"}],["$","meta","10",{"property":"og:description","content":"Stay in our Wooden Room at Brundhavan Garden Resort. <p>Featuring rustic wooden décor, the 160 sq. feet wooden room offers a unique aesthetic and includes a king-size bed, TV, and an attached bathroom. This room combines natural charm with modern conveniences and room service for a truly relaxing stay, priced at ₹2000 per night&nbsp;</p>"}],["$","meta","11",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary_large_image"}],["$","meta","12",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"Brundhavan Garden Resort"}],["$","meta","13",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"Premium resort experience in Thandigudi, Dindigul."}],["$","meta","14",{"name":"twitter:image","content":"https://brundhavangarden.com/og-image.jpg"}]