17:T6ac,<ul><li>For travelers seeking something unique, the Wooden Room blends rustic elegance with contemporary comfort. Sized at 160 square feet, the Wooden Room envelops guests in the warm, calming ambiance of wood-paneled walls and natural textures, creating an atmosphere reminiscent of a cozy mountain chalet.&nbsp;</li><li>A king-size bed dressed in soft linens promises deep, restful sleep, while windows frame lush views and infuse the space with gentle daylight. Modern conveniences are seamlessly integrated—enjoy the in-room flat screen TV for entertainment or wind down after sunset with complementary Wi-Fi and easy access to round-the-clock power.&nbsp;</li><li>The attached bathroom carries the clean, functional style of the main room and is equipped for refreshing showers and daily routines. Guests often praise the pristine maintenance, quick response from room service, and thoughtful inclusion of towels and toiletries.&nbsp;</li><li>The Wooden Room’s distinctive atmosphere makes it a favorite for couples, small families, and nature lovers. Relax in solitude, catch up on your favorite shows, or plan for a day out—every comfort is considered. Its proximity to amenities like the kid’s play park, customizable food options, fire camp, and local adventure offerings make your stay both convenient and memorable.&nbsp;</li><li>Priced at ₹2000 per night, the Wooden Room delivers the best of both worlds—a sense of retreat and a host of thoughtful features right in the lap of Thandikudi’s beautiful hillscape. Whether waking to birdsong, relaxing with loved ones, or steeling yourself for the day’s adventures, this room is designed to make every moment special.&nbsp;</li></ul>18:T40a,<p><strong>Special check-in instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>After you complete your booking, you will receive a confirmation email with all your reservation details. Please keep this confirmation handy and present it to the staff member upon your arrival at Brundhavan Garden Homestay. Our friendly team will then guide you through the check-in process and ensure your stay begins smoothly.</li></ul><p>S<strong>pecific Cancellation Instructions:</strong></p><ul><li>If a customer wishes to remove a activity, game etc alone from a final booking after their payment, they will need to inform about this to the staff at our resort and our team will try to refund the particular amount as soon as possible if they have reached our home stay . if they wish to remove it before their arrival , they can contact the support number and inform about the cancellation of the activity,game,&nbsp; etc. the refund will be initiated and the they will mention about the refund time. Cancellation of food should be done before 4 hours.</li></ul>6:[["$","main",null,{"className":"p-4 flex flex-col gap-10 mb-20","children":[["$","$L15",null,{}],["$","$L16",null,{"id":5,"name":"Wooden Room","description":"<p>Featuring rustic wooden décor, the 160 sq. feet wooden room offers a unique aesthetic and includes a king-size bed, TV, and an attached bathroom. This room combines natural charm with modern conveniences and room service for a truly relaxing stay, priced at ₹2000 per night&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEGP5WQ6DKB9P49N7C4.webp","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEJ001E7TB7QY0X60Y7.webp"],"alt":["wooden-room-1","wooden-room-2"],"price":2000,"square_ft":160,"capability":2,"beds":1,"about_stay":"$17","check_in_rules":"<ul><li>Check-In From 9:00 AM - Anytime</li><li>Early Check-In Subject To Availability</li><li>Minimum Check-In Age - 18</li></ul>","check_out_rules":"<ul><li>Check-Out Before Noon</li><li>Express Check-Out</li></ul>","room_rules":"$18","services":[{"service_name":"CCTV Surveillance","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F618NHQ5XNQYGPB1G1MEWJ.jpg","icon_alt":"cctv-surveillance-icon"},{"service_name":"Childrens Park","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F64ECB9E2E45X3V1ZXN2GV.png","icon_alt":"childrens-park-icon"},{"service_name":"Free Wifi","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F60KKTBQBPMQ32CST14F38.jpg","icon_alt":"free-wifi-icon"},{"service_name":"Indoor & Outdoor Games","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6G29D0811E2FSNMYRXF6A.jpg","icon_alt":"indoor-outdoor-games-icon"},{"service_name":"Jeep Safari","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6EZAMVK4MF81WRPE11F20.jpg","icon_alt":"jeep-safari-icon"},{"service_name":"Parking Space","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F63VHDK8TY03HY9WN29ADF.png","icon_alt":"parking-space-icon"},{"service_name":"Room Service","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F64ZJFBD2ZA4VD9Y4S7GRA.png","icon_alt":"room-service-icon"},{"service_name":"Fire Camp","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6JP942CQGYBDSFS16QHRX.jpg","icon_alt":"fire-camp-icon"},{"service_name":"Extra Bed(1)","icon_pic":"https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/Service_Icons/01K9F6J98WM974YVF0YC0F0A75.jpg","icon_alt":"extra-bed1-icon"}]}],["$","$L19",null,{"id":"5"}],["$","$L1a",null,{"roomProps":[{"id":2,"name":"Deluxe Room","description":"<p>&nbsp;Our largest accommodation option, the Deluxe Room spans 160 sq. feet and comfortably houses up to six guests with three double cot-sized beds along with a private attached bathroom. It is ideal for families or groups who want spacious privacy combined with scenic hill views and modern amenities, including 24-hour power supply, CCTV surveillance, and room service. Priced at ₹3000 per night, this room offers an unparalleled stay experience.&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724ASZ0MP1Y95W98ZWN9B.jpg","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F724AT4VGRTH6GR2NWSNTP.jpg"],"alt":["deluxe-room-1","deluxe-room-2"],"price":3000,"square_ft":160,"capability":6,"beds":3},{"id":3,"name":"Standard Room","description":"<p>Designed for couples or solo travelers, this cozy 110 sq. feet room contains one king-size bed with an attached bathroom, providing a quiet and intimate space for rest. Guests enjoy all basic amenities such as Wi-Fi and clean surroundings with easy access to outdoor activities. Price per night is ₹1500.&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F73HP9W5K2TNS5X8T53G2V.jpg","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F73HPDHJPH573SNWTSDJHQ.webp"],"alt":["standard-room-1","standard-room-2"],"price":1500,"square_ft":110,"capability":2,"beds":1},{"id":5,"name":"Wooden Room","description":"<p>Featuring rustic wooden décor, the 160 sq. feet wooden room offers a unique aesthetic and includes a king-size bed, TV, and an attached bathroom. This room combines natural charm with modern conveniences and room service for a truly relaxing stay, priced at ₹2000 per night&nbsp;</p>","pictures":["https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEGP5WQ6DKB9P49N7C4.webp","https://portal.brundhavangarden.com/storage/RoomCategoriesPictures/01K9F74VEJ001E7TB7QY0X60Y7.webp"],"alt":["wooden-room-1","wooden-room-2"],"price":2000,"square_ft":160,"capability":2,"beds":1}],"currRoomId":5}]]}],["$","$L1b",null,{}]]
